{"seq":3,"slug":"self-service-provisioning","title":"自助式资源供给","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/self-service-provisioning","wordCount":850,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"自助式资源供给\">自助式资源供给</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>自助式资源供给（Self-Service Provisioning）是平台工程从&quot;工单驱动&quot;走向&quot;产品化服务&quot;的关键转变。它让开发者通过标准化的接口（门户、CLI 或 API）直接申请和管理云资源，无需提交工单等待运维团队处理。</p>\n<p>传统模式下，开发者申请一个数据库需要经历：提交工单 → 运维评估 → 手动创建 → 配置网络 → 返回连接信息，整个过程可能需要数天。自助式供给将这一流程缩短到分钟级别，同时通过策略引擎确保合规和安全。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统模式&#10;        A1[开发者] --&gt;|提交工单| B1[运维团队]&#10;        B1 --&gt;|评估审批| C1[手动创建]&#10;        C1 --&gt;|配置完成| D1[返回信息]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 自助模式&#10;        A2[开发者] --&gt;|声明式申请| B2[平台 API]&#10;        B2 --&gt;|策略检查| C2[自动创建]&#10;        C2 --&gt;|Secret 注入| D2[即刻可用]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统模式\n        A1[开发者] --&gt;|提交工单| B1[运维团队]\n        B1 --&gt;|评估审批| C1[手动创建]\n        C1 --&gt;|配置完成| D1[返回信息]\n    end\n    subgraph 自助模式\n        A2[开发者] --&gt;|声明式申请| B2[平台 API]\n        B2 --&gt;|策略检查| C2[自动创建]\n        C2 --&gt;|Secret 注入| D2[即刻可用]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>工单驱动</th>\n<th>半自助</th>\n<th>完全自助</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>申请方式</td>\n<td>邮件/Jira 工单</td>\n<td>门户表单 + 人工审批</td>\n<td>API/CLI 自动化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待时间</td>\n<td>1-5 个工作日</td>\n<td>数小时</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工介入</td>\n<td>全程人工</td>\n<td>审批环节</td>\n<td>策略自动判断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规检查</td>\n<td>事后审计</td>\n<td>审批时检查</td>\n<td>策略引擎实时执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可追溯性</td>\n<td>工单记录</td>\n<td>门户日志</td>\n<td>完整审计链</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展性</td>\n<td>线性增长（运维人力）</td>\n<td>有限改善</td>\n<td>线性扩展（无人力瓶颈）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"声明式资源申请\">声明式资源申请</h2><p>声明式资源申请是自助供给的技术基础。开发者通过描述期望状态（而非执行步骤）来申请资源，平台负责将期望状态转化为实际资源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 开发者提交的资源声明文件&#10;apiVersion: platform.example.com/v1&#10;kind: ResourceBundle&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: order-service-resources&#10;  namespace: order-team&#10;  labels:&#10;    app: order-service&#10;    tier: critical&#10;    cost-center: engineering&#10;spec:&#10;  database:&#10;    engine: postgresql&#10;    version: &#39;15&#39;&#10;    size: medium&#10;    highAvailability: true&#10;    backup:&#10;      enabled: true&#10;      retentionDays: 30&#10;&#10;  cache:&#10;    engine: redis&#10;    version: &#39;7&#39;&#10;    size: small&#10;    clusterMode: false&#10;&#10;  queue:&#10;    engine: kafka&#10;    topics:&#10;      - name: order-events&#10;        partitions: 6&#10;        replicationFactor: 3&#10;      - name: order-notifications&#10;        partitions: 3&#10;        replicationFactor: 3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 开发者提交的资源声明文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">platform.example.com/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ResourceBundle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service-resources</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">critical</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cost-center</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">engineering</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    engine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgresql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'15'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">medium</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    highAvailability</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    backup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      enabled</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retentionDays</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    engine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">small</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    clusterMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  queue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    engine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kafka</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    topics</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        partitions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        replicationFactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order-notifications</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        partitions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        replicationFactor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DeclarativeProvisioningFlow {&#10;  step1_declare: {&#10;    action: &#39;开发者编写资源声明 YAML&#39;;&#10;    location: &#39;应用仓库的 platform/ 目录&#39;;&#10;    validation: &#39;本地 Schema 校验（IDE 提示）&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  step2_commit: {&#10;    action: &#39;提交到 Git，触发 CI 流水线&#39;;&#10;    checks: [&#39;YAML Schema 合法性&#39;, &#39;策略引擎预检（成本、配额、安全）&#39;, &#39;命名规范检查&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;  step3_approve: {&#10;    action: &#39;自动或人工审批&#39;;&#10;    autoApprove: &#39;非生产环境 + 标准规格 + 预算内&#39;;&#10;    manualApprove: &#39;生产环境 critical 资源 + 超预算&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  step4_provision: {&#10;    action: &#39;Crossplane/Terraform 创建资源&#39;;&#10;    feedback: &#39;实时状态更新到门户和 Slack&#39;;&#10;    timeout: &#39;5 分钟（非生产）/ 15 分钟（生产）&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  step5_inject: {&#10;    action: &#39;连接信息自动注入到应用&#39;;&#10;    mechanism: &#39;External Secrets → Kubernetes Secret → 环境变量&#39;;&#10;    verification: &#39;健康检查确认连接可用&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DeclarativeProvisioningFlow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  step1_declare</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '开发者编写资源声明 YAML'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    location</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F975