dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queueTopics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      production</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">databases</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">cacheInstances</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queueTopics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    overQuota</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '触发审批 → 评估是否需要扩大配额'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>审批自动化的目标是让 80% 以上的标准请求无需人工介入即可完成。对于需要人工审批的请求，平台应该提供充足的上下文信息（成本预估、安全影响、现有资源使用情况），让审批者能快速做出决策。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资源生命周期管理\">资源生命周期管理</h2><p>自助供给不仅包括资源创建，还包括资源的整个生命周期：更新、扩缩容、备份和销毁。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ResourceLifecycle {&#10;  create: {&#10;    trigger: &#39;声明式申请 + 审批通过&#39;;&#10;    automation: &#39;Crossplane Composition 自动编排&#39;;&#10;    notification: &#39;创建完成通知到 Slack/门户&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  update: {&#10;    trigger: &#39;修改资源声明并提交&#39;;&#10;    safeGuards: [&#10;      &#39;破坏性变更（如缩容）需要显式确认&#39;,&#10;      &#39;生产环境变更自动创建变更记录&#39;,&#10;      &#39;不可逆操作（如删除数据列）需要多级审批&#39;,&#10;    ];&#10;  };&#10;  scale: {&#10;    manual: &#39;修改 size 参数&#39;;&#10;    auto: &#39;基于指标的自动扩缩容策略&#39;;&#10;    cooldown: &#39;扩容后 15 分钟内不缩容&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  backup: {&#10;    automated: &#39;平台默认策略（每日备份、保留 30 天）&#39;;&#10;    onDemand: &#39;开发者自助触发即时备份&#39;;&#10;    restore: &#39;从备份恢复到新实例（避免覆盖生产）&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  destroy: {&#10;    trigger: &#39;删除资源声明或显式销毁&#39;;&#10;    safeGuards: [&#39;生产资源销毁需要多级审批&#39;, &#39;软删除（标记弃用）+ 7 天保留期&#39;, &#39;数据备份确认后才实际删除&#39;];&#10;  };&#10;  dormancy: {&#10;    detection: &#39;30 天无访问的非生产资源&#39;;&#10;    action: &#39;自动通知 → 确认保留或自动暂停&#39;;&#10;    savings: &#39;非生产资源休眠可节省 40-60% 成本&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ResourceLifecycle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  create</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '声明式申请 + 审批通过'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    automation</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'Crossplane Composition 自动编排'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    notification</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '创建完成通知到 Slack/门户'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  update</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '修改资源声明并提交'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    safeGuards</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '破坏性变更（如缩容）需要显式确认'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '生产环境变更自动创建变更记录'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '不可逆操作（如删除数据列）需要多级审批'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  scale</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    manual</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '修改 size 参数'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '基于指标的自动扩缩容策略'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    cooldown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '扩容后 15 分钟内不缩容'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  backup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    automated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '平台默认策略（每日备份、保留 30 天）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    onDemand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '开发者自助触发即时备份'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    restore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '从备份恢复到新实例（避免覆盖生产）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  destroy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    trigger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '删除资源声明或显式销毁'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    safeGuards</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'生产资源销毁需要多级审批'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'软删除（标记弃用）+ 7 天保留期'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'数据备份确认后才实际删除'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  dormancy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    detection</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '30 天无访问的非生产资源'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '自动通知 → 确认保留或自动暂停'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    savings</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '非生产资源休眠可节省 40-60% 成本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>资源生命周期管理中最容易被忽视的是&quot;资源回收&quot;。许多组织的云账单中有 30-40% 的费用来自不再使用的&quot;僵尸资源&quot;。平台应该自动检测闲置资源并提醒所有者，或在确认后自动回收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((自助式资源供给))&#10;    声明式申请&#10;      YAML 描述期望状态&#10;      Git 版本化&#10;      Schema 校验&#10;    智能审批&#10;      风险评估模型&#10;      自动审批80%&#10;      上下文丰富&#10;    资源生命周期&#10;      创建更新扩缩&#10;      备份恢复&#10;      闲置回收&#10;    关键指标&#10;      自助完成率&#10;      供给时间&#10;      僵尸资源率\">mindmap\n  root((自助式资源供给))\n    声明式申请\n      YAML 描述期望状态\n      Git 版本化\n      Schema 校验\n    智能审批\n      风险评估模型\n      自动审批80%\n      上下文丰富\n    资源生命周期\n      创建更新扩缩\n      备份恢复\n      闲置回收\n    关键指标\n      自助完成率\n      供给时间\n      僵尸资源率</pre><ul>\n<li>自助式资源供给是平台工程从工单驱动到产品化服务的核心转变</li>\n<li>声明式申请以 Git 为中心，实现资源变更的版本化、可审计和可回滚</li>\n<li>智能审批基于风险等级自动决策，目标是 80% 请求无需人工介入</li>\n<li>资源生命周期管理覆盖创建、更新、扩缩容、备份和销毁全流程</li>\n<li>闲置资源检测和回收是成本优化的重要手段</li>\n<li>配额管理在保障自助灵活性的同时，防止资源滥用和成本失控</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自助式资源供给","id":"自助式资源供给"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"声明式资源申请","id":"声明式资源申请"},{"level":2,"text":"审批流程自动化","id":"审批流程自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"资源生命周期管理","id":"资源生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"基础设施抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/infrastructure-abstraction"},"next":{"title":"环境管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/platform-engineering/self-service-infrastructure/environment-management"}}